   "locked": false,
   "text": "Body equality is the whole freshness check \u2014 any upstream edit changes the body and re-distills.\nBest-effort: an unreadable bank falls through to the distiller (a crawl must never fail on a cache).\nCost: one GCS get_blob (~50ms) against one LLM call (~2s).",
   "originalText": "Body equality is the whole freshness check \u2014 any upstream edit changes the body and re-distills.\nBest-effort: an unreadable bank falls through to the distiller (a crawl must never fail on a cache).\nCost: one GCS get_blob (~50ms) against one LLM call (~2s).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
